  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Clearly $x>2$. Write the given inequality<br />as<br />$\\begin{aligned}<br />& \\left(x^2-6 x+8\\right) \\log (x-2)>0 \\Leftrightarrow(x-2)(x-4) \\log (x-2)> \\\\<br />& 0 \\\\<br />& \\Leftrightarrow(x-4) \\log (x-2)>0 \\quad[\\therefore x>2]<br />\\end{aligned}$<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/3oxXvNf76QSQceF-Ow1dFlaYH4BOy9y9a8VtiBEtZ-E.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
